{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<link href=\"https://hangeul.pstatic.net/hangeul_static/css/nanum-myeongjo.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<link href=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/web_font/nexon_gothic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style type=\"text/css\">@font-face {font-family:'Cafe24Danjunghae';src:url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_twelve@1.1/Cafe24Danjunghae.woff') format('woff');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}\r\n            /* 기본 */\r\n            .font_NMr {font-family:'NanumMyeongjo' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMeb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoExtraBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NGL {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Light' !important;}\r\n            .font_NGB {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Bold' !important;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap * {box-sizing:border-box;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:break-word;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd, p, div, span, section, i, form, fieldset, input, table, tr, th, td, button, textarea, br {margin:0;padding:0;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap i {font-style:normal;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd {list-style:none;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap img {width:auto;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic', sans-serif;width:100%;max-width:1200px !important;font-weight:400;margin:0 auto;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:-0.05em;-webkit-letter-spacing:-0.25px;text-align:center;color:#424242;line-height:1.4;}\r\n\r\n            /* FONT SIZE CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap p {transform:rotate(0.04deg);}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p0 {font-size:1.5em;}/*18px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {font-size:1.6667em;}/*20px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {font-size:2em;}/*24px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {font-size:2.3333em;}/*28px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {font-size:2.6667em;}/*32px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {font-size:4em;}/*48px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {font-size:5.1667em;}/*62px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p7 {font-size:6em;}/*72px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p_sub {font-size:0.6em;vertical-align:baseline;}/*아래첨자*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p_sup {font-size:0.6em;vertical-align:text-top;}/*위첨자*/\r\n\r\n            /* FONT STYLE CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .fw_600 {font-weight:600;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ls_08 {letter-spacing:-0.08em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_08 {line-height:0.8;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_10 {line-height:1;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_12 {line-height:1.2;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ta_l {text-align:left;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ta_r {text-align:right;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .t_up {text-transform:uppercase;}\r\n\r\n            /* FONT COLOR CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_white {color:#fff;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_whitegray {color:#e5e5e5;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_black {color:#121212;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_pink {color:#ea6182;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_apricot {color:#ebd0c7;}\r\n\r\n            /* BG COLOR CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_whitegray {background-color:#f9f9f9;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_mint {background-color:#3dd9d4;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_blue {background-color:#10b0ff;}\r\n\r\n            /* MARGIN CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_02em {margin-top:0.2em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_04em {margin-top:0.4em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt-05em {margin-top:-0.5em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {margin-top:10px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {margin-top:20px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {margin-top:30px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_40 {margin-top:40px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {margin-top:50px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_60 {margin-top:60px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {margin-top:70px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {margin-top:150px;}\r\n\r\n            /* PADDING CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_08em {padding-top:0.8em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_08em {padding-bottom:0.8em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_3em {padding-bottom:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:80px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pd_2em {padding:2em;}\r\n            \r\n            /* GRID · FLEX 스타일 */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_2step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 49%);justify-content:space-between;row-gap:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_3step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 32%);justify-content:space-between;row-gap:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_4step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4, auto);justify-content:space-between;row-gap:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_textList {display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.4167em auto;justify-content:center;align-items:start;gap:1.25em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_c {display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_c_auto {flex:auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}\r\n\r\n            /* 기타 스타일 */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w51 {width:51%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w75 {width:75%;margin-left:12.5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w90 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mgAuto {margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pos_r {position:relative;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .wMax {width:max-content;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .wFit {width:fit-content;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10 {border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10v {border-radius:10px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .border_lineBox {border:1px solid #121212;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Round_TitleBar {display:inline-block;border-radius:200px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Box_Shadow {-webkit-box-shadow:0 0 1.25em 0.5em rgba(0,0,0,0.04); box-shadow:0 0 1.25em 0.5em rgba(0,0,0,0.04);}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {display:none;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {display:block;}\r\n\r\n            /* 타이틀 */\r\n            .Product_Title .ProductName i {background-color:#fff;padding:0 1em;}\r\n            .Product_Title .ProductName::after {content: '';position:absolute;display:block;width:100%;height:1px;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -0.1em);background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#d9d9d9 20%,#d9d9d9 80%,#fff 100%);z-index:-1;}\r\n            .NumberBox {display:inline-block;padding:0.5em 0.684em 0.4em;border-radius:100%;background-color:#f3aab5;}\r\n\r\n            /* 키이미지 */\r\n            .KeyImg .key_TextBox {position:absolute;top:17%;}\r\n            \r\n            /* 제너럴 밸런스 프로바이오틱스 플러스 제품특징 */\r\n            .Product_Features {display:grid;grid-template-columns:28.8% 1fr;column-gap:4em;row-gap:2em;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li {display:flex;width:100%;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px dotted #646464;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li p {padding:0.15em 0 0.05em;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li:last-of-type {border-bottom:none;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li p:nth-of-type(1) {margin-left:0.2em;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li p:nth-of-type(2) {margin-left:0.8em;line-height:1.2;}\r\n\r\n            /* 프로바이오틱스의 기능성 */\r\n            .Function_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, auto);justify-content:center;column-gap:4em;}\r\n            .Function_Grid img {width:18vw;max-width:141px;}\r\n\r\n            /* Bio- Support 코팅 특허 공법 */\r\n            .Coating_Method > div {position:absolute;}\r\n            .Coating_Method > div:nth-child(1) {position:absolute;top:24.6429%;left:56.4444%;}\r\n            .Coating_Method > div:nth-child(1)::after {content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:-51%;width:100%;height:2px;background-color:#3dd9d4;}\r\n            .Coating_Method > div:nth-child(2) {position:absolute;top:62.3214%;left:56.4444%;}\r\n            .Coating_Method > div:nth-child(2)::after {content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:-51%;width:100%;height:2px;background-color:#10b0ff;}\r\n            .Coating_Method .title_bar {width:fit-content;border-radius:0 10px 0 10px;padding:0.25em 1em 0.1em;}\r\n\r\n            /* 11종 1일 섭취량 기준 50억 CFU 보장 */\r\n            .CFU_Guarantee ul {position:absolute;width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 33.3%);justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}\r\n            .CFU_Guarantee ul li:nth-child(1) {padding:0 1em 0 2em;}\r\n            .CFU_Guarantee ul li:nth-child(2) {padding:0 1em;}\r\n            .CFU_Guarantee ul li:nth-child(3) {padding:0 2em 0 1em;}\r\n            .CFU_Guarantee ul:nth-child(1) {height:14.5%;}\r\n            .CFU_Guarantee ul:nth-child(2) {height:20.9%;top:14.5%;grid-template-columns:30% 33% 30%;justify-content:center;}\r\n            .CFU_Guarantee ul:nth-child(3) {height:20.9%;top:39.4%;grid-template-columns:30% 33% 30%;justify-content:center;}\r\n            .CFU_Guarantee ul:nth-child(4) {height:20.9%;top:64.5%;grid-template-columns:30% 33% 30%;justify-content:center;}\r\n            .CFU_Guarantee ul:nth-child(5) {height:14.5%;bottom:0;}\r\n\r\n            /* 유산균 배양 건조물 (포스트바이오틱스) */\r\n            .Post_Biotics {display:grid;grid-template-columns:28% 8% 28% 8% 28%;justify-content:space-between;}\r\n            .Post_Biotics li img {width:31%;}\r\n            .Post_Biotics li:nth-child(odd) {border:2px solid #3dd9d4;}\r\n            .Post_Biotics li:nth-child(3) {border-color:#10b0ff;}\r\n            .Post_Biotics .title_bar {display:inline-block;width:100%;}\r\n\r\n            /* 권장 대상 */\r\n            .Recommended_Target {display:grid;grid-template-columns:46% 1fr;justify-content:center;align-items:center;column-gap:4em;}\r\n\r\n            /* 브랜드 스토리 */\r\n            .Brand_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:40% 56%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border:#ccc solid 1px;text-align:left;}\r\n            .Brand_Grid .logo_img {max-width:40% !important;margin-top:1em;}\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1200px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {margin-top:0.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {margin-top:1.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {margin-top:2.5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_40 {margin-top:3.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {margin-top:4.1667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_60 {margin-top:5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {margin-top:5.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {margin-top:12.5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10, .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10v {border-radius:0.8333vw;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1020px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:10px;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p0 {font-size:1.8em;}/*18px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {font-size:2em;}/*20px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {font-size:2.4em;}/*24px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {font-size:2.8em;}/*28px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {font-size:3.2em;}/*32px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {font-size:4.8em;}/*48px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {font-size:5.2em;}/*62px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p7 {font-size:7em;}/*72px*/\r\n                .grid_textList img {margin-top:0.2em;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:920px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:9px;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .w75 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {display:block;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {display:none;}\r\n                .Product_Features .flex_box li p {padding:0.3em 0 0.2em;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:820px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:8px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:720px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:7px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:620px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:6px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:510px) {\r\n                .Brand_Grid {grid-template-columns:1fr;row-gap:4.1667vw;text-align:center;}\r\n                .Brand_Grid .logo_img {margin-top:0 !important;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:520px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:5px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:420px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:4px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:320px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:3px;}\r\n            }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"Product_DetailWrap\">\n<section class=\"KeyImg pos_r\">\n<div class=\"key_TextBox w90 lh_12\">\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB color_black\">장 건강의 새로운 기준,<br/>\r\n온 가족을 위한 프로바이오틱스!</p>\n<p class=\"p3 font_NMr color_pink mt_04em\">General Balance Probiotics Plus</p>\n<p class=\"p4 mt_20\">소중한 장 건강을 위한 선택<br/>\r\n하루 한 포로 간편하게!</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Probiotics_Plus/Probiotics_Plus_keyimg.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"w90 mt_150\">\n<div class=\"Product_Features ta_l\">\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"p5 color_black lh_12\">제너럴 밸런스<br/>\r\n프로바이오틱스 플러스 <span class=\"fw_600 color_pink\">제품특징</span></p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Probiotics_Plus/Probiotics_Plus_img_01.jpg\"/>\n<ul class=\"flex_box\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">1</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">세계 3대 유산균 기업 캐나다 로셀(Rosell)사 균주</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">2</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">프로바이오캡 특허 코팅 공법</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">3</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">1일 섭취량 기준 50억 CFU 보장</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">4</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">유산균배양건조물 (포스트바이오틱스) <span class=\"p_sub\">* 부원료</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">5</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">요거트맛 으로 남녀노소 맛있게 섭취 가능</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"mt_150\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Probiotics_Plus/Probiotics_Plus_img_02.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p5 mt-05em\">프로바이오틱스의 <span class=\"fw_600 color_pink\">기능성</span></p>\n<ul class=\"Function_Grid w75 mt_40\">\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Probiotics_Plus/Probiotics_Plus_img_03_1.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\">유산균 증식 및<br/>\r\n\t유해균 억제</p>\n</li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Probiotics_Plus/Probiotics_Plus_img_03_2.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\">배변활동<br/>\r\n\t원활</p>\n</li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Probiotics_Plus/Probiotics_Plus_img_03_3.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\">장 건강에<br/>\r\n\t도움을 줌</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"p2 color_pink mt_50\">***</p>\n<p class=\"p4 color_black mt-05em\">기능성 원료인 <span class=\"color_pink fw_600\">유산균</span>을<br/>\n<span class=\"color_pink fw_600\">1포</span>로 간편하게 섭취 할 수 있도록!</p>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"Product_Title mt_150\">\n<p class=\"ProductName pos_r font_NMr t_up lh_12\"><i>General Balance</i></p>\n<p class=\"font_NMeb lh_12\">PROBIOTICS PLUS</p>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NGB color_black mt_04em\">제품 특징</p>\n<p class=\"p1 font_NMr mt_02em\">KEY POINT</p>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"w75 mt_50\">\n<div class=\"NumberBox font_NMb p5 color_white lh_10\">1</div>\n<p class=\"p5 fw_600 color_black mt_20\">세계 3대 유산균 기업<br/>\r\n캐나다 로셀<span class=\"font_NGL\">(ROSELL<span class=\"p_sup\">®</span>)</span>사 균주 사용</p>\n<img class=\"w51 mt_70\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Probiotics_Plus/Probiotics_Plus_img_04_1.jpg\"/> <img class=\"mt_60\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Probiotics_Plus/Probiotics_Plus_img_04_2.jpg\"/>\n<ul class=\"grid_4step mt_40\">\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"p7 lh_08 ls_08 color_apricot\">80</span><span class=\"font_NGL p1\"> 년의<br/>\r\n\t프로바이오틱스<br/>\r\n\t연구, 개발 역사</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"p7 lh_08 ls_08 color_apricot\">40</span><span class=\"font_NGL p1\"> 종<br/>\r\n\t이상의 자체 균주 보유,<br/>\r\n\t개발된 formula 500개 이상</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"p7 lh_08 ls_08 color_apricot\">60</span><span class=\"font_NGL p1\"> 개국<br/>\r\n\t이상에 공급하여 인정받은<br/>\r\n\t프로바이오틱스</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"p7 lh_08 ls_08 color_apricot\">5</span><span class=\"font_NGL p1\"> 단계의<br/>\r\n\t안전성 프로그램을 통해<br/>\r\n\t검증된 프로바이오틱스</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"w75 mt